        <mxCell id="legend-content" value="&lt;b&gt;Initial Flow:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;SessionInitialized → DocumentProcessing → ChunkStored&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Module 1: Question Generation Pipeline (Purple)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;ChunkStored → GeneratingQuestions → EvaluatingQuestions → RefiningQuestions → QuestionSetReady → Practicing → Completed → Archived&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Module 2: Mind Map Generation (Orange)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;ChunkStored → MindMapGenerating → MindMapReady → MindMapReviewing → MindMapEditing → MindMapExported → Archived&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Module 3: Document Q&amp;A Module (Green)&lt;/b&gt;&#10;ChunkStored → QAModuleReady → AskingQuestion → Answering → QAReview → Archived&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Error Handling (Red, Dashed):&lt;/b&gt;&#10;Failed state can be reached from: DocumentProcessing, GeneratingQuestions, MindMapGenerating, QAModuleReady, Practicing, MindMapEditing, AskingQuestion" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1240" width="800" height="220" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="workflow-note" value="Workflow Features:&#10;&#10;1. Three parallel learning paths&#10;   from ChunkStored state&#10;&#10;2. All paths converge at&#10;   Archived state&#10;&#10;3. Comprehensive error handling&#10;   from multiple states&#10;&#10;4. Session can restart from&#10;   Archived to SessionInitialized&#10;&#10;5. Document processing is&#10;   prerequisite for all modules" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="1240" width="200" height="180" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="state-colors" value="State Color Coding:&#10;&#10;🟢 Green: SessionInitialized, Q&amp;A Module&#10;   (Initial and Q&amp;A states)&#10;&#10;🟡 Yellow: DocumentProcessing&#10;   (Processing state)&#10;&#10;🔵 Blue: ChunkStored&#10;   (Branch point)&#10;&#10;🟣 Purple: Question Generation&#10;   (QG pipeline)&#10;&#10;🟠 Orange: Mind Map Generation&#10;   (Mind map flow)&#10;&#10;🔴 Red: Failed&#10;   (Error state)&#10;&#10;⚪ Gray: Archived&#10;   (End state)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
